  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ヘドロの　なみで　じぶんの\nまわりに　いるものを　こうげきする。\nどく　じょうたいに　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "오물 파도로 자신의\n주위에 있는 포켓몬을 공격한다.\n독 상태로 만들 때가 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用污泥波攻擊\n自己周圍所有的寶可夢。\n有時會讓對手陷入中毒狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une vague de détritus attaque tous les Pokémon\nautour du lanceur. Peut aussi empoisonner.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Greift alle Pokémon im Umkreis mit einer Schlammwelle\nan. Diese werden eventuell auch vergiftet.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una onda tóxica que daña a los Pokémon de alrededor.\nPuede envenenar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Lancia un’onda di fango che attacca tutti i Pokémon\nnelle vicinanze. Può anche avvelenarli.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user strikes everything around it by swamping\nthe area with a giant sludge wave. This may also\npoison those hit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ヘドロの　波で　自分の\n周りに　いるものを　攻撃する。\n毒状態に　することが　ある。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用污泥波攻击\n自己周围所有的宝可梦。\n有时会陷入中毒状态。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una onda tóxica que daña a los Pokémon de alrededor.\nPuede envenenar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
